OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader told resign over   
OL,4,A'hostile behaviour'                    
OL,6,FThe leader of Dudley Council is facing 
OL,7,Fcalls to resign following a damning    
OL,8,Freport into how the authority handled a
OL,9,Fseries of property deals.              
OL,11,FAuditors Grant Thornton have concluded 
OL,12,FConservative councillor Patrick Harley 
OL,13,Fsubjected council officers to "undue   
OL,14,Fpressure" and "coercive and hostile    
OL,15,Fbehaviour" over the deals.             
OL,17,FIt follows an investigation into a     
OL,18,Fnumber property negotiations including 
OL,19,Fthe failed sale of the former          
OL,20,FWellington Road leisure centre site in 
OL,21,FDudley.                                
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
