OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader told resign over   
OL,4,A'hostile behaviour'                    
OL,6,FHarley - who faces a motion calling for
OL,7,Fhis removal - has rejected stepping    
OL,8,Fdown, saying he was holding council    
OL,9,Fstaff to account for the benefit of the
OL,10,Fresidents of the borough.              
